---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: text
---
Forget known directories matching a name or path pattern

Usage: furet remove [OPTIONS] <PATTERN>

Arguments:
  <PATTERN>  

Options:
      --confirm  Ask before removing each directory ([y/N/a/q])
      --yes      Never ask for confirmation (for scripts)
      --dry-run  Print what would be removed and change nothing
  -h, --help     Print help
